# Copy to ~/.config/gmail-mirror/mbsyncrc and put your address in both places.
# The app password lives in the login Keychain (service "mbsync-gmail"), see README.

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User you@gmail.com
PassCmd "security find-generic-password -a you@gmail.com -s mbsync-gmail -w"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/Mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

# All Mail holds every message once (labels are copies of it), so one channel is
# the whole account. Pull only new mail and flag changes, never deletions: this
# is a hedge against losing the account, so nothing on the server can empty it.
Channel gmail-all
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Near :gmail-local:AllMail
Create Near
Sync PullNew PullFlags
Expunge None
SyncState *
